---
title: 'Character & Light Cone Progression Calculator'
---

Character and Light Cone detail pages now include a progression calculator. Adjust the target Level and, for Characters, skill training levels and Trace unlocks to see the required EXP Materials, Ascension Materials, Trace Materials, and Credits update in real time.

Skill previews and training targets can be adjusted independently, so you can inspect skill effects while planning progression costs.

Select a Material in the cost list to open Item Details, including its icon, rarity, and descriptions. This update also improves the progression panel and Trace interaction feedback.
